Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:10.50,italics,Izuku,0,0,0,,It all started with the birth of a \Nbioluminescent baby in Qingqing City, China.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:14.13,italics,Izuku,0,0,0,,That marked the first appearance of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.13,0:05:17.34,italics,,0,0,0,,peculiar abilities that would \Ncome to be known as Quirks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.17,0:05:21.22,italics,Izuku,0,0,0,,More and more holders of \Nthese abilities were born,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.97,0:05:25.39,italics,Izuku,0,0,0,,and now the world has become \Na super-powered society,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.39,0:05:28.39,italics,Izuku,0,0,0,,where nearly 80% of the total \Npopulation have some kind of Quirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:33.56,italics,Izuku,0,0,0,,A new vocation arose in this \Nchaotic world: the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:38.74,italics,Izuku,0,0,0,,Heroes are a select group licensed by
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:43.41,italics,,0,0,0,,the government to use their powerful \NQuirks in service to society.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.62,0:05:49.33,italics,Izuku,0,0,0,,But this age also has another type of hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.21,0:05:51.87,italics,Izuku,0,0,0,,Nobody chooses them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.87,0:05:55.38,italics,,0,0,0,,These illegal heroes act \Non their own initiative.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:05:58.59,italics,Izuku,0,0,0,,What is their brand of justice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:05.18,italics,Izuku,0,0,0,,Can they even be called \Nheroes in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.31,0:06:13.56,italics,Izuku,0,0,0,,This is the story of vigilantes \Ntrying to become real heroes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.77,0:06:18.53,italics,Izuku,0,0,0,,before Izuku Midoriya ever \Nwent to U.A. High School.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.74,0:07:58.71,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (upper),0,0,0,,{\an1\fad(1,137)\pos(210,182.001)\fs120\shad0\bord0\c&H0E00C5&}vi{\alphaFF\t(23,65,\alpha00)}gilan{\alphaFF\t(65,107,\alpha00)}te
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.83,0:07:58.75,sign_TimesNewRoman,text (lower),0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(3428,137\fs20)\pos(294,531)}a member of a volunteer committee organized to suppress\Nand punish crime summarily (as when the processes of law are viewed\Nas inadequate); broadly: a self-appointed doer of justice
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:07:59.50,sign_Verdana,episode title,0,0,0,,{\i1\an1\fs90\fsp3.9\bord0\shad12\c&H40E6FF&\fad(129,343)\pos(1416,822)}I'm Here
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:05.30,main,villain A,0,0,0,,I... hunger!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.30,0:08:06.59,main,citizen A,0,0,0,,A villain's rampaging!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.59,0:08:07.72,main,citizen B,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:09.05,main,villain A,0,0,0,,Munch munch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.26,0:08:14.81,main,villain A,0,0,0,,Teeth are life!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:17.14,main,villain C,0,0,0,,He's got my bike!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.39,0:08:18.35,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Oh man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.35,0:08:19.77,main,All Might,0,0,0,,It's fine now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.73,0:08:22.86,main,All Might,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.53,0:08:25.53,main,All Might,0,0,0,,Because I am here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.53,0:08:29.03,main,All Might,0,0,0,,Take this, villain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.03,0:08:31.95,main,All Might,0,0,0,,Detroit Smash!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.95,0:08:33.66,main,villain A,0,0,0,,My teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.91,0:08:35.50,main,citizen D,0,0,0,,Wow! All Might!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:36.87,main,citizen E,0,0,0,,It was over in one hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:39.00,main,citizen F,0,0,0,,That's why he's the number one hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.09,0:08:45.09,main,All Might,0,0,0,,Is everyone safe and sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:47.05,main,All Might,0,0,0,,That's what matters most.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:49.97,main,villain A,0,0,0,,My teeth...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:51.34,main,All Might,0,0,0,,I didn't mean you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:52.85,main,All Might,0,0,0,,Until next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.27,0:09:03.90,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,All Might... I just knew seeing \Nhim in person would be awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:06.90,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Whoa, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.32,0:09:09.15,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,I'll be late for class!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:17.25,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.83,0:09:21.12,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Aw, look what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:25.25,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,I had just bought that. Now apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:28.76,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Hands and knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.17,0:09:32.05,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,I-I'm very sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.09,0:09:34.76,main,Tokage,0,0,0,,He really did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.76,0:09:36.51,main,Tochi,0,0,0,,Ain't you got any pride?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.93,0:09:37.93,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,What a wuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.65,0:09:43.98,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.98,0:09:45.15,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,You punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.78,0:09:48.90,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:50.24,main,Tochi,0,0,0,,Asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.45,0:09:54.91,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.16,0:09:59.12,italics,narration,0,0,0,,Koichi Haimawari, a typical college \Nstudent who spends all his time at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.87,0:10:01.58,italics,narration,0,0,0,,His Quirk is Slide and Glide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.71,0:10:08.55,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\i1\c&H222917&\bord12\shad0\fs51\3c&HFAF198&\fad(507,1)\pos(1230,798)}Quirk: Slide and Glide
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:03.83,italics,narration,0,0,0,,It lets him move around as if sliding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.33,0:10:08.55,italics,narration,0,0,0,,Activating it requires at least three \Npoints of contact with a surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.01,0:10:10.55,italics,narration,0,0,0,,But it's only as fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.17,0:10:13.30,italics,narration,0,0,0,,as a slow bike!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.30,0:10:15.05,main,citizen G,0,0,0,,Oh, a mobility-type Quirk?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.47,0:10:16.93,main,citizen H,0,0,0,,That could come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.93,0:10:19.10,main,citizen I,0,0,0,,It's not very fast, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:21.73,main,citizen J,0,0,0,,Looks kind of gross, like a cockroach!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.73,0:10:23.10,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Bug off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.69,0:10:33.61,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,With a pop heart
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:36.62,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,With a pop beat
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.62,0:10:39.79,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,Hope my feelings make it to you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.79,0:10:42.41,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,With a pop, hip, and hop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.25,0:10:48.50,sign_Verdana,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an1\i1\c&H222917&\bord12\shad0\fs27\3c&HBEA9F6&\fad(507,1)\pos(1284,798)}\h\h\h(Self-proclaimed) freelance idol\N{\fs96\fsp12}Pop{\3c&HDFE8EF&}☆{\3c&HBEA9F6&}Step
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.75,0:10:47.54,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Everyone! Thanks for showing up again today!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.84,0:10:53.63,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,I'm always on the prowl
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.63,0:10:59.72,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,Searching for the smile from that day
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.43,0:11:03.31,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,With this voice as my guide
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.31,0:11:06.48,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,I never stop believing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.48,0:11:09.40,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,That someday you'll find me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.40,0:11:12.65,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,That someday you'll hold me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.36,0:11:17.37,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,Shine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.37,0:11:21.04,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,Sparkle
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:24.04,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,P-O-P! S-T-E-P!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.04,0:11:26.37,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,Hope it makes it to you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.37,0:11:29.29,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,Shine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:32.51,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,Sparkle
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:35.97,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,C'mon, 1-2-3, pop step jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:35.80,top,Koichi,0,0,0,,A surprise concert by Pop☆Step.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.97,0:11:39.14,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,I'll fly away to where you are
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.30,0:11:38.68,top,Koichi,0,0,0,,Hopefully the police won't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.14,0:11:42.85,italics,Pop,0,0,0,,I'll fly away
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.43,0:11:40.97,top,Koichi,0,0,0,,Her singing's unimpressive,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.97,0:11:43.10,top,,0,0,0,,and you can't tell what she looks \Nlike under the flashy makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.60,0:11:47.35,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,But she sparkled like a gem just then,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:49.65,main,,0,0,0,,because she was soaring through the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.44,0:11:52.78,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,I wish {\i1}I{\i0} had the Leap Quirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.57,0:11:56.45,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Shoot, I've got to get to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:13.09,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,People admire what they \Nliterally look up at.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:15.92,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,And when they look down at something,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.30,0:12:19.14,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,the opposite tends to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.64,0:12:27.89,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.15,0:12:30.61,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,It sure isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.94,0:12:34.44,main,boss,0,0,0,,You were late,\Nand I'm deducting it from your pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.69,0:12:35.99,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:38.15,italics,Koichi,0,0,0,,I ended up being late anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:40.24,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:42.33,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Damn it, next time I see him...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:46.20,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,The cockroach creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.50,0:12:53.00,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,My Quirk's called Spike.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:54.63,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,It's full of stabby pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.67,0:12:56.97,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Scared ya, didn't I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:03.01,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,You loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:12.15,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:14.40,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,What's with those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.40,0:13:16.32,main,,0,0,0,,The cops should do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.57,0:13:19.45,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Oh, it ticks me off. Right up to here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.41,0:13:21.53,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,That does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.12,0:13:25.20,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Tonight, I'm gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.66,0:13:29.04,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Change into my special suit,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.41,0:13:31.79,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,and go crazy with my Quirk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:35.21,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,This'll make me feel better!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.55,0:13:37.09,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Who cares about the law!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.09,0:13:39.26,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,I'll do everything I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.80,0:13:41.89,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Look out, there's my first target!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:44.68,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,You dropped this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.51,0:13:48.02,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,The late-night bus stop is over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.06,0:13:51.56,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,You've got ten minutes until the last train!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.69,0:13:54.31,main,girls,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.82,0:14:01.03,main,citizen J,0,0,0,,Oh! Nice Guy's at it again tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.03,0:14:03.57,main,citizen K,0,0,0,,Wow, that's so nice. Super nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.57,0:14:05.62,main,citizen L,0,0,0,,Thank you, Nice Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:07.70,main,citizen M,0,0,0,,Great work, Nice Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.79,0:14:10.91,main,citizen N,0,0,0,,Put my trash out on your way home!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.04,0:14:16.17,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,It feels great when I do so many good deeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.05,0:14:20.05,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,I am beat. And thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:21.80,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.26,0:14:23.51,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.55,0:14:25.60,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Wait, who're you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.35,0:14:29.31,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Pop☆Step?! What're you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.68,0:14:33.48,main,Pop,0,0,0,,You always go around town picking \Nup trash and such, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:35.36,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Your name's, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.69,0:14:36.77,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Cockroach Guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.77,0:14:37.94,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Nice Guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.90,0:14:42.24,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Is that dweeby hoodie supposed \Nto be an All Might cosplay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:43.11,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.82,0:14:47.99,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,He's my standard for what it means to \Nbe of utmost service to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.37,0:14:50.70,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,And it's not dweeby! It's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:53.62,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Utmost, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:55.75,main,Pop,0,0,0,,In your own little way?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.75,0:14:58.88,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right. It's important \Nto know one's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.88,0:14:59.80,main,Pop,0,0,0,,You're Knows-His-Place Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:01.13,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Nice Guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.34,0:15:06.89,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Be careful you don't go too far playing \Nyour idol games, or the cops'll catch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.89,0:15:08.60,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Oh, and thanks for the drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.93,0:15:12.64,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Hey! Who said anything about \Ngames?! I'm for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.64,0:15:13.31,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.06,0:15:15.23,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.60,0:15:17.23,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,What's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.15,0:15:21.44,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Check out what she's \Nwearin' under that coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:23.65,main,Tokage,0,0,0,,What a freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.65,0:15:25.15,main,Tochi,0,0,0,,I know her. She's famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.15,0:15:28.53,main,Tochi,0,0,0,,She's a cringy high schooler \Nwho flashes her butt online.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.53,0:15:31.33,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,You supposed to be a hero, \Nin all that makeup?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.33,0:15:32.79,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Or more like a villain?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.20,0:15:36.00,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Stop! Nobody sees my face in public!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:36.00,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:38.75,main,Tochi,0,0,0,,Then we'll take pics of \Nit, and post 'em online!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.75,0:15:39.92,main,Pop,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.25,0:15:41.50,main,Tokage,0,0,0,,Dude, you're the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.71,0:15:43.72,top,Koichi,0,0,0,,Hey! S-Stop that, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.97,0:15:47.22,main,Tokage,0,0,0,,Huh? What do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.22,0:15:49.22,main,Tochi,0,0,0,,Get lost, and take your dumb hoodie with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.22,0:15:52.72,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,No, it's... not dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.85,0:15:57.35,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Y-You're right, it's none of my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.73,0:15:59.11,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.11,0:16:00.77,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.61,0:16:07.82,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,I-It's not a dumb hoodie,\Nand I'm not "Knows-His-Place Guy."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.11,0:16:12.87,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,I'm the dude who can't ignore \Nsomeone in trouble: Mr. Nice Guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.87,0:16:15.50,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,I'm no good at fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:18.04,main,Tochi,0,0,0,,Huh? What're you talkin'—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:19.21,italics,Koichi,0,0,0,,But I can surprise them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.71,0:16:23.96,main,Tochi,0,0,0,,What was that supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.05,0:16:30.89,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,I didn't recognize you \Nat first, but I do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.85,0:16:34.31,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Nobody asked you to butt in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.72,0:16:37.89,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,The cockroach creep wants to play hero?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.44,0:16:40.23,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.23,0:16:41.65,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,That settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.02,0:16:43.98,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,We're not just gonna beat you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.98,0:16:47.82,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,We're gonna wreck both you {\i1}and{\i0} your store!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:53.91,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,While we're at it, we'll strip weirdo \Nchick naked for the world to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.79,0:16:59.21,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Wh-Why take it that far?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:03.00,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Because you piss me off so \Ndamn much. Why do you think?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:07.34,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Stop it! I'll call the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:09.97,main,Tokage,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you call for a hero instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.97,0:17:12.97,main,Tokage,0,0,0,,Go on, say, "Help me, All Might!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.97,0:17:14.81,main,Tochi,0,0,0,,Yeah, go on and say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.85,0:17:19.27,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,All Might's not always available.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.06,0:17:21.56,main,Tochi,0,0,0,,C'mon, do it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.61,0:17:28.24,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,No matter how much we want \Nhim to come save us,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.41,0:17:32.91,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,he's not going to drop in out of the—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:36.54,main,Tochi,0,0,0,,Wh-What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.54,0:17:38.12,main,Tokage,0,0,0,,Somebody just dropped in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.12,0:17:45.50,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Were you guys talking about All Might?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.50,0:17:47.26,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,He won't be showing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.05,0:17:50.05,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.63,0:17:53.18,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:17:59.89,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,That landing was a little \Nawkward, but don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.89,0:18:03.86,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,A trash pile makes for a \Nnice cushion in a pinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.27,0:18:06.65,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,By strengthening my neck further,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.65,0:18:10.82,main,,0,0,0,,I can reduce my risk of \Ncervical injury and concussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.11,0:18:12.86,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,What's your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:14.66,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Old ma—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:22.29,main,Tokage,0,0,0,,What the hell, man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.29,0:18:23.79,main,Tochi,0,0,0,,Why'd you do that all of a sudden?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:26.84,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Who am I, and what am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.13,0:18:29.46,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,I'll answer those questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:35.09,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,They call me Knuckleduster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.72,0:18:39.56,top,Knuckle,0,0,0,,I take out the trash—scumbags like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.06,0:18:39.52,sign_Verdana,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an1\i1\c&H222917&\bord12\shad0\fs36\3c&H71D5A7&\fad(507,1)\pos(1164,750)}\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hJanitor of the Fist\N{\fs90}Knuckleduster
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.93,0:18:43.52,main,Tokage,0,0,0,,Is this guy insane?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.94,0:18:50.32,main,Knuckleduster,0,0,0,,No discoloration.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:52.28,main,Knuckleduster,0,0,0,,He's not one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.57,0:18:53.74,main,Knuckleduster,0,0,0,,Next...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.71,0:19:05.21,main,Knuckleduster,0,0,0,,He's not one either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.04,0:19:07.34,main,Knuckleduster,0,0,0,,Hey, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:11.01,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,I-I'm not involved with these guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.01,0:19:13.09,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,You've got promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.05,0:19:17.01,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,I could use some help with my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.26,0:19:19.14,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,I'm gonna turn you into a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.39,0:19:20.18,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,No thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:23.39,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm not interested in that sorta thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.39,0:19:24.85,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,I-I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:27.90,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,That's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.57,0:19:32.28,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,You revere All Might,\Nand you're into helping people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.28,0:19:35.99,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Yet you say you're not interested \Nin doing hero work?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.70,0:19:41.62,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I could never get a \Nlicense with my measly Quirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.37,0:19:45.04,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.37,0:19:47.04,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,"So what"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.21,0:19:49.75,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Powerful Quirks and pro licenses?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.75,0:19:53.51,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Those things have nothing at \Nall to do with true justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.26,0:19:58.47,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,When you're faced with something you \Nmust do, can you take action or not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.47,0:20:02.64,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,That's the only question the \Nhero's spirit has to answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.39,0:20:06.98,italics,Koichi,0,0,0,,In other words, this guy's unlicensed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.27,0:20:14.19,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Enough of your justice BS, you old fart!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.57,0:20:19.49,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Stand down. Taking a hostage won't \Nmake me hit you any softer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.49,0:20:21.62,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,She's no hostage!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:25.37,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,I'm gonna use Spike to mess up her face!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.41,0:20:29.83,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Nothin' else is gonna satisfy me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:30.92,main,Pop,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.21,0:20:32.63,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:34.13,flashbackitalicstop,Knuckle,0,0,0,,When you're faced with \Nsomething you must do...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:36.05,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.34,0:20:38.43,flashback italics,Knuckle,0,0,0,,can you take action or not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.43,0:20:43.43,flashback italics,Knuckle,0,0,0,,That's the only question the \Nhero's spirit has to answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.11,0:20:54.28,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Well done, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.00,0:21:12.67,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Wrong on all three counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.09,0:21:15.42,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,But I'll check their IDs, just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.80,0:21:25.72,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Kid, I'll teach you all about \Nhow satisfying hero work is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.60,0:21:29.94,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Nothing feels better than \Npounding on villains.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.69,0:21:35.19,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Th-That's absolutely a "no" for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.86,0:21:40.61,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,What went through my head then \Nwasn't "thanks" or "you saved me."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.82,0:21:45.37,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,It was, "This guy's even more dangerous."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.91,0:21:49.71,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,So, about that dangerous guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.96,0:21:54.34,sign_Arial,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H43494D&\3c&HEEEFF3&\shad0\bord12\b0\fs45}Student ID\N{\c&H272E56&} Registration number:\N{\c&H43494D&}Sociology Department\N{\c&H272E56&}DOB: {\c&H43494D&}February 22, XXXX\N{\c&H272E56&}Date of enrollment: {\c&H43494D&}X X, XXXX\N{\c&H272E56&}Full name: {\c&H43494D&}Koichi Haimawari\N Hitonami University President
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.33,0:21:53.21,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Koichi Haimawari, age 19.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.21,0:21:55.21,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Freshman at Hitonami University.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.21,0:21:58.30,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Hey, that's my student ID! And my wallet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.59,0:22:00.26,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,I'll call you "Koichi."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.26,0:22:02.51,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Or would you prefer "Nice Guy"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.97,0:22:05.14,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Please don't rifle through my stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.14,0:22:07.02,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,You can call me "master."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.02,0:22:09.73,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,I told you, I'm not going \Nto be your apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.73,0:22:12.60,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,And this is my place, so I wish you'd leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:16.73,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,What, all you've got in \Nthe fridge is barley tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.40,0:22:19.44,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Ah, you do have beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.44,0:22:22.07,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Those are for when upperclassmen \Nfrom my school come by!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.07,0:22:25.16,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,You're too young to have this stuff.\nIt's confiscated.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.16,0:22:27.66,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,He's not listening to a word I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.00,0:22:30.00,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.21,0:22:33.25,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Those pieces of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.25,0:22:38.21,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,I swear I'll kill both the cockroach \Ncreep {\i1}and{\i0} the old thug.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.21,0:22:41.42,main,Tochi,0,0,0,,No, we should keep away from that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.55,0:22:42.93,main,hat guy (No. 6),0,0,0,,My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.60,0:22:47.64,main,hat guy (No. 6),0,0,0,,You guys got roughed up bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.85,0:22:50.43,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,Huh? Who're you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.68,0:22:55.44,main,hat guy (No. 6),0,0,0,,I've got just the medicine you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.31,0:23:00.99,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,I'm on the hunt for a drug that's \Nmaking the rounds in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.11,0:23:03.78,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,A drug?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.87,0:23:10.58,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's new and dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:14.00,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,They call it Trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.25,0:23:19.00,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,It weakens the user's ability to reason\Nand boosts their Quirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.30,0:23:23.72,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,In other words, it turns \Nordinary people into villains.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.43,0:23:33.69,main,Kugizaki,0,0,0,,This is wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.44,0:23:38.31,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,At this rate, villains'll be \Npopping up all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.77,0:23:40.07,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Can't ignore that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.53,0:23:44.65,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,But shouldn't we leave that \Nstuff to heroes and the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.65,0:23:46.24,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Can't count on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.86,0:23:51.37,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Trigger-induced pop-up villains \Nsuddenly emerge from the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.99,0:23:55.92,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,The police and pro heroes will \Nalways be a step behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.75,0:23:58.83,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,That's where we come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.09,0:24:01.59,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Did you just say "we"?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.59,0:24:02.76,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.76,0:24:06.47,main,,0,0,0,,You and I'll stop anyone suspicious, \Nand check their tongues.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.47,0:24:07.47,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Tongues?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.47,0:24:10.68,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,A Trigger addict's tongue changes \Ncolor as a side effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.31,0:24:13.14,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,It turns dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.14,0:24:17.56,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Oh. So, that's why you were \Nlooking at their tongues.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.56,0:24:18.81,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.81,0:24:21.73,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,I'll beat up anyone with a \Nblack tongue on the spot,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.73,0:24:23.65,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,question them about who their dealer is,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.65,0:24:25.95,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,and smash this drug trade at the source!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.70,0:24:28.78,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,You just up and start hitting them?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.78,0:24:30.16,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,You gotta make the first move!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.66,0:24:34.04,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Hit the junkies before they \Ntake their Trigger hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.04,0:24:37.21,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,I doubt they'll cooperate when \Nyou say, "Show me your tongue."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.21,0:24:40.17,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Anyone that suspicious gets a beatdown too!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.88,0:24:44.01,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,You are kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.17,0:24:48.80,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Or so I hoped, but you weren't kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.18,0:24:51.89,main,Pop,0,0,0,,What's all the fuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.89,0:24:54.22,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Oh, Pop☆Step!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.93,0:24:56.93,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Well, you see, we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.64,0:25:02.06,main,Pop,0,0,0,,So, you're looking for junkies and dealers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.02,0:25:04.53,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Thanks for yesterday, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.53,0:25:08.57,main,Pop,0,0,0,,But I haven't forgotten the way you \Ntried to leave me high and dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.07,0:25:11.66,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,You do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.28,0:25:13.78,main,Pop,0,0,0,,So, Nice Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.78,0:25:14.95,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,You can call me "Koichi."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.95,0:25:16.83,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Is that your real name?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.83,0:25:20.88,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Okay, Koichi. Why're you \Nhelping him with this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.38,0:25:26.09,main,Pop,0,0,0,,What was that pause for?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.09,0:25:29.55,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I mean, if I don't watch this guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.55,0:25:31.72,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,he's liable to punch every \Nsingle person who walks past.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.09,0:25:34.89,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,I'm making sure to hit the \Nsuspicious ones first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.89,0:25:36.89,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,All those flighty youngsters, for starters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.89,0:25:40.23,main,Pop,0,0,0,,That approach is way too random.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.23,0:25:42.86,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Why don't you two use your heads some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.40,0:25:47.86,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Someone's definitely taken pictures \Nof villains who've popped up in town,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.86,0:25:49.95,main,Pop,0,0,0,,so first narrow down your \Nlocations by searching for
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.95,0:25:54.03,main,,0,0,0,,"villain I've never seen" or \N"villain from out of nowhere."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.03,0:25:55.99,main,Pop,0,0,0,,Then you can start questioning people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.20,0:25:57.45,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Hey, that's clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.45,0:25:58.08,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.08,0:25:59.29,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.45,0:25:59.29,top,Koichi,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.83,0:26:01.00,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Stick out your tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.62,0:26:03.46,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.46,0:26:06.71,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,This guy just looks like \Nan ordinary office worker!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.71,0:26:07.59,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,Stick out your tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.89,0:26:14.60,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.18,0:26:17.81,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Are those action figures, like for kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.81,0:26:20.31,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,A grown-ass adult walking around with dolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.31,0:26:21.60,main,,0,0,0,,That's suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.60,0:26:24.27,main,Pop,0,0,0,,There are lots of people \Ninto that sort of thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.52,0:26:27.94,main,Kugutsu,0,0,0,,Um, I work in the toy business.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.94,0:26:30.74,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,See? He's just trying to do his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.74,0:26:32.45,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,That's what I'm about to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.78,0:26:34.66,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,First, I make him do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.12,0:26:41.08,main,Aizawa,0,0,0,,Acts of violence in broad daylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.41,0:26:42.87,main,Aizawa,0,0,0,,Not very sensible.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.54,0:26:47.13,main,Aizawa,0,0,0,,Are you one of those instant villains \Nwho are so common these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.17,0:26:49.38,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,You must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.13,0:26:54.01,main,Knuckle,0,0,0,,the Erasure Hero: Eraser Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.85,0:28:27.98,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Hi, Koichi Haimawari here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.98,0:28:30.44,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,I've started doing hero work, despite my lack of a license.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.86,0:28:33.11,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,My hero name is The Crawler!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.11,0:28:36.28,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,I get involved in a major incident!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.49,0:28:38.20,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,Next time, "Takeoff"!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.20,0:28:40.07,main,Koichi,0,0,0,,I want to fly, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.07,0:28:40.37,main,,0,0,0,,
